#. module: shoe_maker
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:shoe_maker.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Scenario 1: </strong>The simplest way to add products to an order is "
"to directly select your services from the <strong>Product Catalog</strong>. "
"Just click the \"Product Catalog\" button in your sales order lines and "
"select\n"
"        the products you wish to sell. Note that you can filter products "
"services by leveraging the filters in the sidebar on the left side of the "
"screen!"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Scenarij 1: </strong>Najpreprostejši način za dodajanje izdelkov v "
"naročilo je, da svoje storitve neposredno izberete v <strong>Katalogu "
"izdelkov</strong>. Preprosto kliknite gumb \"Katalog izdelkov\" v vrsticah "
"prodajnega naročila in izberite\n"
"        izdelke, ki jih želite prodajati. Upoštevajte, da lahko izdelke in "
"storitve filtrirate z uporabo filtrov v stranski vrstici na levi strani "
"zaslona!"

#. module: shoe_maker
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:shoe_maker.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Scenario 1:</strong> Most products need a human assessment as the "
"remaining quantity cannot be automatically computed. For those, a Recurring "
"Task is created in the Project App. This task reappears every week, and you "
"can\n"
"            personalize it with a checklist to avoid forgetting anything."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Scenarij 1:</strong> Večina izdelkov potrebuje človeško oceno, saj "
"preostale količine ni mogoče samodejno izračunati. Za te se v aplikaciji "
"Projekt ustvari ponavljajoča se naloga. Ta naloga se znova pojavi vsak teden "
"in jo lahko\n"
"            prilagodite s kontrolnim seznamom, da ne bi ničesar pozabili."

#. module: shoe_maker
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:shoe_maker.welcome_article_body
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Scenario 2:</strong> For products that can be tracked, such as laces "
"and soles, you can use automated purchases. To try it, confirm a new <font "
"class=\"text-o-color-5\">order adding i</font>\n"
"            <strong>\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">nsoles with size "
"40-42</span>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"            </strong>\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Scenarij 2:</strong> Za izdelke, ki jim je mogoče slediti, kot so "
"vezalke in podplati, lahko uporabite avtomatizirane nabave. Če želite to "
"preizkusiti, potrdite novo <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">naročilo z "
"dodanimi v</font>\n"
"            <strong>\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">\n"
"                    <span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">ložki velikosti 40–"
"42</span>\n"
"                </font>\n"
"            </strong>\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"

